scn 1
# Passing within a small click (2026-11-16; tools/legion_overtake_test.py), the owner's case:
# a single-file column of 12 at a 2.5-cell pitch, Aramon Knights
# (fast 3x3, speed 2.9) and Swordsmen (slow 2x2, 1.10) mixed, sent with ONE right-click to one
# point about 600 px from the click's centre, as a player sends a mixed selection. Asset-free.
# Open field, move order.
name overtake-click-col-600
ticks 3000
players 1
weapons off
map flat 128 200
type slow mover 2 2500 1 1.10
type fast mover 3 2500 1 2.9
group S0 0 slow 1 cells 60,43
group F1 0 fast 1 cells 60,45
group F2 0 fast 1 cells 60,48
group S3 0 slow 1 cells 60,51
group F4 0 fast 1 cells 60,53
group S5 0 slow 1 cells 60,56
group S6 0 slow 1 cells 60,58
group F7 0 fast 1 cells 60,60
group S8 0 slow 1 cells 60,63
group F9 0 fast 1 cells 60,65
group S10 0 slow 1 cells 60,68
group F11 0 fast 1 cells 60,70
at 5 move S0,F1,F2,S3,F4,S5,S6,F7,S8,F9,S10,F11 60 20
